  },
  "bio": [
   {
    "text": "Slimefoot began as a spore on the Weatherlight's hull, escaped workers about to pry it off, and fell into the engine compartment.",
    "cites": [
     "return-dominaria-episode-10-2018-05-16-e0"
    ],
    "links": [
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/return-dominaria-episode-10-2018-05-16#:~:text=It%20plunged%20down%20through,landed%20with%20a%20splat."
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "It grew in the dark, learning the voices of the crew, until Arvad found it and its sprouts in the storage space beside the engine compartment.",
    "cites": [
     "return-dominaria-episode-10-2018-05-16-e1",
     "return-dominaria-episode-10-2018-05-16-e5"
    ],
    "links": [
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/return-dominaria-episode-10-2018-05-16#:~:text=This%20Cabal%20agent%20has,entire%20academy%20of%20mages",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/return-dominaria-episode-10-2018-05-16#:~:text=Slimefoot%20freed%20a%20second,at%20both%20of%20them."
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "Jhoira decided to accept the thallids aboard and take them back to Yavimaya when possible.",
    "cites": [
     "return-dominaria-episode-10-2018-05-16-e11",
     "return-dominaria-episode-10-2018-05-16-r6"
    ],
    "links": [
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/return-dominaria-episode-10-2018-05-16#:~:text=I%20must%20have%20brought,we%20have%20a%20chance.",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/return-dominaria-episode-10-2018-05-16#:~:text=She%20watched%20it%20steadily,long%20moment%2C%20then%20smiled."
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "On deck, Slimefoot met Karn, who told it the ship was heading to Urborg to destroy Belzenlok in the Cabal's Stronghold.",
    "cites": [
     "return-dominaria-episode-10-2018-05-16-e12"
    ],
    "links": [
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/return-dominaria-episode-10-2018-05-16#:~:text=We%20are%20on%20our,Stronghold%20of%20the%20Cabal."
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "In Urborg it conversed with the spirits, and then asked them for help, which they promised to provide, and Jhoira directed the ship to the Stronghold after the call succeeded.",
    "cites": [
     "return-dominaria-episode-11-2018-05-23-e3",
     "return-dominaria-episode-12-2018-05-30-e5",
     "return-dominaria-episode-12-2018-05-30-e8"
    ],
