     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/return-dominaria-episode-12-2018-05-30#:~:text=But%20we%20will%20call%20something%20that%20can%20.",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/return-dominaria-episode-12-2018-05-30#:~:text=Jhoira%20agreed.%20It%20was,this.%20%22To%20the%20Stronghold.%22"
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "Years later, Shanna freed Slimefoot and the powerstone from the Weatherlight's tentacles, and Shanna, Tiana and Slimefoot escaped the ship.",
